# Demon Wall attacking as though it didn't have defender (CR 609.4) is otherwise an ordinary attack: a creature with
# vigilance doesn't tap to attack (CR 508.1f, 702.20b). On turn 3 Bot1 pays {5}{B} for the Wall's two +1/+1 counters and
# casts Pym Particles on it ("Target creature gains vigilance until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn"). The Wall
# attacks as a 5/5 and stays untapped; Bot2 goes from 20 to 15. It still has defender beside the keywords Pym Particles gave.

